# DoodlePaws UX/UI

## Design tokens

Use Tailwind theme tokens from `src/frontend/src/index.css`:

- `primary` (#FFB347), `secondary` (#B4E1FF), `surface`, `on-surface`, `slate-border`
- Utilities: `shadow-hard`, `rounded-geo`, `pill-badge`

## Typography

- Headlines: uppercase, italic, `font-black`, tight tracking
- Labels: `text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em]`

## Interaction

- Buttons/cards: hard shadow + hover translate + shadow removal
- Pet card rotation: stable hash from `pet.id` — never `Math.random()`

## Copy

- Use `{pet.name}`, `{pet.quote}`, `{pet.status}` — no hardcoded pet names or fake counts
- Status badge must match `pet.status` (`available`, `pending`, `adopted`)

## Loading / errors

Every API fetch page needs:

```tsx
try { ... } catch { setError(...) } finally { setLoading(false) }
```

Show retry button on error. See `docs/ux-ui-flows/ux-ui-rules.md`.

## Navigation

- Orphan routes (`/about`, `/foster`) are forbidden — use `/#why-doodlepaws` anchor instead
